The guide contains two pure insertions totaling 24 source lines, six natural Sentences and four InlineCode values. The first three sentences preserve the previously missing page-context renderer registration, exact cargo Markdown stage command, all registered pages/new directory, all input targets/other-page aliases, old renderer byte preservation and review-before-projection-update. The following three preserve separate HTML eight-resource output selection, omitted existing default, and a new explicitly recorded execution rather than treating a stopped attempt as success. Original paragraph order and the unchanged HTML command are retained between the additions.

